      "source": "Interface declaring a query operation that can be represented\nwith a query string. This interface is typically implemented\nby classes representing an SQL operation such as <code>SELECT</code>,\n<code>INSERT</code>, and such.",
      "translation": "声明可表示为查询字符串的查询操作的接口。该接口通常由代表 SQL 操作（如 `<code>SELECT</code>`、`<code>INSERT</code>` 等）的类实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the string-representation of this operation to\nbe used with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> creation.",
      "translation": "返回此操作的字符串表示形式，用于与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> 创建一起使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
